# LF everywhere, checked in and checked out.
#
# This is built on Windows and compiled on a macOS runner. Git on Windows would
# otherwise hand the runner a workflow whose `run:` blocks end in CRLF, and bash
# reads the carriage return as part of the last argument - so the failure is a
# command not found for something that is plainly right there in the log.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ipa binary
